# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:29
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Service Manager</guilabel> module allows you to have an "
"overview of all plugins of the &kde; Daemon, also referred to as &kde; "
"Services. Generally, there are two types of service:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>सेवाप्रबन्धकः</guilabel> मॉड्यूल् भवन्तं &kde; डेमन, &kde इति अपि "
"उच्यते; सेवाएँ। सामान्यतया सेवायाः द्वौ प्रकारौ स्तः- १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:37
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load-on-Demand Services"
msgstr "लोड-ऑन-डिमाण्ड् सेवाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:38
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of available &kde; services which will be started on demand. "
"They are only listed for convenience, as you cannot manipulate these "
"services."
msgstr ""
"एषा उपलब्धानां सूची अस्ति &kde; सेवाः येषां आरम्भः आग्रहेण भविष्यति। ते "
"केवलं सुविधायै सूचीबद्धाः सन्ति, यतः भवान् एताः सेवाः परिवर्तयितुं न "
"शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:46
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Startup Services"
msgstr "स्टार्टअप सेवाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:47
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This shows all &kde; services that can be loaded on &kde; startup. Services "
"checked in the <guilabel>Use</guilabel> column will be invoked on next "
"startup."
msgstr ""
"एतेन सर्वाणि &kde; सेवाः ये &kde; startup इति । <guilabel>Use</guilabel> "
"स्तम्भे परीक्षिताः सेवाः अग्रिमे आरम्भे आह्विताः भविष्यन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:50
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be careful with deactivation of unknown services: some services are vital "
"for &kde;; do not deactivate services if you do not know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"अज्ञातसेवानां निष्क्रियीकरणे सावधानाः भवन्तु: केचन सेवाः &kde;; यदि भवान् "
"किं करोति इति न जानाति तर्हि सेवां निष्क्रियं न कुर्वन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:54
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the <guilabel>Status</guilabel> of a service, select it in the "
"list. Then you can use the <guibutton>Start</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>Stop</guibutton> to change the status of a service from "
"<guilabel>Not running</guilabel> to <guilabel>Running</guilabel> and vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"सेवायाः <guilabel>Status</guilabel> परिवर्तयितुं सूचीयां तत् चिनोतु । ततः "
"भवान् <guibutton>Start</guibutton> तथा <guibutton>Stop</guibutton> "
"इत्येतयोः उपयोगेन <guilabel>Not running</guilabel> इत्यस्मात् "
"<guilabel>Running</guilabel> तथा vice इति सेवायाः स्थितिं परिवर्तयितुं "
"शक्नोति विपरीतम् ।"